<%- include('partials/header') %>

  <main>
    <section class="page-header">
      <div class="container">
        <h1>How to Help</h1>
        <p>There are many ways to support our rescue — every bit makes a difference.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="help-sections">

          <!-- Donate -->
          <div class="help-section" id="donate">
            <h2>💛 Donate</h2>
            <p>Your donations go directly to veterinary care, food, supplies, and transport for the dogs in our care. We're a registered 501(c)(3) nonprofit, so your donation is tax-deductible.</p>
            <div class="donate-box">
              <a href="https://paypal.me/dallyshope4paws" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn--primary btn--lg">Donate via PayPal</a>
              <p class="ein">Tax ID (EIN): 82-3825005 &middot; All donations are tax-deductible.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Foster -->
          <div class="help-section" id="foster">
            <h2>🏠 Foster</h2>
            <p>Fostering saves lives. When you open your home to a rescue dog, you're giving them a safe place to decompress, heal, and prepare for adoption. We provide all supplies and cover all veterinary costs — you provide the love.</p>
            <p>What fostering involves:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Providing a safe, indoor living space for the dog</li>
              <li>Daily feeding, exercise, and basic care</li>
              <li>Transporting to vet appointments (we cover all costs)</li>
              <li>Helping us learn the dog's personality for matching with adopters</li>
            </ul>
            <p>Interested? Email us at <a href="mailto:foster@dallyshope4paws.org">foster@dallyshope4paws.org</a> or use our <a href="/contact">contact form</a>.</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Volunteer -->
          <div class="help-section" id="volunteer">
            <h2>🤝 Volunteer</h2>
            <p>We're always looking for volunteers to help with transport, events, fundraising, and social media. No experience necessary — just a love for dogs and a willingness to help.</p>
            <p>Some ways you can volunteer:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Transport dogs between shelters, fosters, and vet appointments</li>
              <li>Help at adoption events and fundraisers</li>
              <li>Collect and drop off returnable bottles and cans</li>
              <li>Share our posts and help spread the word on social media</li>
            </ul>
            <p>Reach out to us at <a href="mailto:volunteer@dallyshope4paws.org">volunteer@dallyshope4paws.org</a> to get involved.</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Wishlist -->
          <div class="help-section" id="wishlist">
            <h2>📦 Supply Wishlist</h2>
            <p>We always need the basics. If you'd like to donate supplies, here's what helps most:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Dog food (dry and canned)</li>
              <li>Dog treats and chews</li>
              <li>Leashes, collars, and harnesses</li>
              <li>Dog beds and blankets</li>
              <li>Cleaning supplies</li>
              <li>Crates and carriers</li>
            </ul>
            <p>Supplies can be dropped off at our partner location, <strong>Country Feed Store</strong> in Amsterdam, NY. Or <a href="/contact">contact us</a> to arrange a pickup.</p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
